notes.content:
It's been exactly one year since Guns'N'Zombies release! 
Since then we've developed a separate spin-off, eliminated hundreds of zombies and bugs, translated the game into five languages, and today we're adding Chinese and Spanish to the bunch. 

In today's update: 
- Full migration to Unity 5; 
- Spanish version; 
- Chinese version. 
- Grenade launcher now deals damage to crystals; 
- Minor rebalancing of armor, towers and their upgrades. 
- All cache is cleared after DLC update, so now DLC won't require more HDD space; 

Gamepad: 
- Gamepad supported in server selection menu; 
- Improved usability in Maps and Store. 

Bugs: 
- No menu or character displayed problem some of our DLC players had on some levels - now fixed; 
- Achievements after completion of the game and DLC - now stable; 

Plus a Halloween-themed surprise for our players. Happy Halloween!

